ehne/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mircohoehne/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mircohoehne/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mircohoehne/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mircohoehne/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T11:51:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T11:51:02Z","body":"I saw that [#111017](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111017) got merged and that it references this PR. I appreciate that it was mentioned, but I have to admit it stings a bit to see my original implementation, basically the same code, merged through another PR instead.\r\n\r\nThe additional complexity in this PR only came from trying to address feedback and follow the discussion that happened here. So it feels a bit demotivating that those efforts to align with reviewer comments ended up making this version look unnecessarily complicated while the same initial idea was later merged for being simpler.\r\n\r\nThat said, I am still glad the feature made it into Godot. I just hope that in similar cases in the future, earlier contributions can be built on rather than replaced, as that would make it easier to stay motivated to keep contributing.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446588037/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]